<title>USA: Information Management names Kon chairman.</title>
<headline>Information Management names Kon chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Information Management Technologies Corp said Wednesday that Robert Oxenberg, chairman of the board of directors, resigned his position and that Matti Kon has been appointed acting chairman of the board..</p>
<p>The company gave no reason for the resignation.</p>
<p>Oxenberg will continue to serve as a consultant to the company, Information Management said.</p>
